{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美國女模Sophie Mudd向來喜歡Cosplay扮成各式各樣的動漫人物，近日網上出現將《哈利波特》（Harry Potter）系列男主角「哈利波特」於魔法學院中死對頭公子爺「馬份」，改成女版的二次創作漫畫與AI影片，Sophie亦趕上潮流，穿上霍格華茲的女學生校服，以「馬份大小姐」的一頭金色長髮示人，獲網友留言大讚：「史萊哲林加50分！」</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T14:37:29.380833+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T14:01:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T10:57:18.990387+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T14:30:52.476894+00:00","content_hash":"01fc287e2c7b02d36116c49bee542797297d44429c43337d736f2085b9021ea4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}